    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels so hollow though. like you're telling me to find value in something that doesn't exist anymore. i didn't just lose a job, i lost my entire reality. everything i spent twenty years building is just... smoke. how can you say it's not my identity when everything about how I interact with the world is gone? it's not just a \"bad phase,\" it's the end. there's nothing to come back to.  greco urye can say what you you want but it",
